---
---

<section class="petition-blitz" id="petition-blitz">
  <div class="blitz-bg"></div>

  <div class="container blitz-content">
    <div class="blitz-alert animate-in">
      <span class="blitz-alert-icon">⚠️</span>
      <span class="blitz-alert-text" data-i18n="volunteer.blitz_alert">BALLOT CHALLENGE FILED: JUNE 9, 2026</span>
    </div>

    <h2 class="blitz-headline animate-in" data-i18n="volunteer.blitz_headline">Defend the 22,788</h2>

    <div class="blitz-grid">
      <div class="blitz-context">
        <p class="blitz-text animate-in" data-i18n="volunteer.blitz_p1">
          You did it. The law demanded 10,816 valid signatures from an independent, while the machine's candidate needed just 697. This movement collected and filed 22,788, more than double the requirement. The voters of IL-04 earned a choice on November 3rd.
        </p>
        <p class="blitz-text animate-in" data-i18n="volunteer.blitz_p2">
          Now the machine is trying to take it away. On June 9, 2026, machine lawyers filed an objection with the Illinois State Board of Elections to invalidate your signatures and kick Byron off the ballot, a process that could run into the first week of August. We beat them at the doors. Now we need you to spread the word: tell your neighbors, post the receipts, and expose what the machine is doing to our democracy.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="blitz-stats animate-in">
        <div class="blitz-stat">
          <span class="blitz-stat-number">697</span>
          <span class="blitz-stat-label" data-i18n="volunteer.blitz_machine">The machine's candidate needed</span>
        </div>
        <div class="blitz-stat-arrow">vs.</div>
        <div class="blitz-stat">
          <span class="blitz-stat-number">10,816</span>
          <span class="blitz-stat-label" data-i18n="volunteer.blitz_required">Required by law</span>
        </div>
        <div class="blitz-stat-arrow">→</div>
        <div class="blitz-stat blitz-stat-target">
          <span class="blitz-stat-number">22,788</span>
          <span class="blitz-stat-label" data-i18n="volunteer.blitz_needed">Delivered by the movement</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="blitz-cta animate-in">
      <a href="#petition" class="btn btn-cream btn-massive" data-i18n="volunteer.blitz_download">
        ✊ Join the Fight: Spread the Word
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .petition-blitz {
    position: relative;
    padding: var(--space-4xl) 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .blitz-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--orange) 0%, var(--orange-dark) 100%);
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .blitz-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  /* Alert Banner */
  .blitz-alert {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
    padding: 8px 20px;
    border-radius: 100px;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
    backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
  }

  .blitz-alert-icon {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }

  .blitz-alert-text {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .blitz-headline {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-4xl);
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1;
    color: #ffffff;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  /* Grid */
  .blitz-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
    gap: var(--space-3xl);
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .blitz-text {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .blitz-text:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* Stats */
  .blitz-stats {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-lg);
    padding: var(--space-2xl);
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
  }

  .blitz-stat {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .blitz-stat-number {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-4xl);
    font-weight: 900;
    color: #ffffff;
    display: block;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .blitz-stat-target .blitz-stat-number {
    font-size: var(--text-5xl);
    text-shadow: 0 2px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
  }

  .blitz-stat-label {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
    display: block;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  .blitz-stat-arrow {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-2xl);
    font-weight: 900;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
  }

  /* CTA */
  .blitz-cta {
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .blitz-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-2xl);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .blitz-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .blitz-headline {
      font-size: var(--text-3xl);
    }

    .blitz-stat-target .blitz-stat-number {
      font-size: var(--text-4xl);
    }
  }
</style>
